{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"19609903eda68c8f","type":"text","text":"Player description\n","x":-374,"y":80,"width":250,"height":61},
		{"id":"d5ab19bab78211c0","type":"text","text":"Cavern description\n","x":-374,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":61},
		{"id":"68049592dc02bd08","type":"text","text":"LOOK AT WHO EVER YOU ARE DESCRIBING\n- [[Niels]] a gaunt main with hazel eyes and disheveled hair, extinguishing the flames from his clothes\n- [[Seraphim the lost]] a tall rugged man with brownish gingered hair, looking at his broken helmet wondering what could have dones it\n- [[Nikolai Oak]] a man with long dark curly hair with a nasty scar on his face, wraping his wounds with his ravaged clothes\n- [[Rin and Machi]] an halfling with a lean athletic build with platinium hair reaching down her knees and a human  with very pale skin and dark brown short hair, helping eachother removing their handcuffs","x":0,"y":11,"width":1031,"height":199},
		{"id":"ad0fe6b755562f7d","type":"text","text":"- Wake up in a dark cavern, dizzy and confused not really sure how you got here\n- Your body feels numb, unresponsive a cold breeze surrounds you\n- Fog covers your feet, from the walls of the cavern you hear a quiet pulsating beat.\n- You look arround and notice a fog wall covers the opposite side of the cavern, and see that you are not alone in this dark place.","x":0,"y":-229,"width":640,"height":199},
		{"id":"ad8c992f4c14a22f","type":"text","text":"Allow time for roleplay","x":-374,"y":300,"width":250,"height":61},
		{"id":"21e200b591b14c12","type":"text","text":"Combat start","x":-374,"y":469,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3e0d1d6b4ffa4c1d","type":"text","text":"You see coming from the fog wall 2 armored man with a red tabard holding spears, a hooded figure holding a dagger and a black bear the size of a wagon roll initiative","x":0,"y":418,"width":370,"height":163},
		{"id":"d96b22625128091b","type":"text","text":"After the combat you feel a sharp pain in your brain, \n- [[Seraphim the lost]] in your head you start hearing the sound of a marching army to battle\n- [[Niels]] you see images of someone leaving his study to pick up soldier garments\n- [[Rin and Machi]] you feel the adrenaline of running away with bags full of riches\n- [[Nikolai Oak]] and the smell of a hot meal prepared by your loved one \n\n","x":0,"y":700,"width":800,"height":210},
		{"id":"9f4237358c464ac0","type":"text","text":"Allow time for roleplay","x":-374,"y":960,"width":250,"height":59},
		{"id":"e31bfec2cb6db81a","type":"text","text":"After combat","x":-374,"y":775,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e0d4087e4b422e62","type":"text","text":"Transition\n","x":-372,"y":1148,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bb6c1d51e11b9702","type":"text","text":"You start to see the light in the walls pulsating faster, the beat getting lowder, and suddenly the ground beneath you starts shaking and cracking a rupture swallowing you inside the hole ","x":14,"y":1122,"width":786,"height":112},
		{"id":"669f70e94d5b9574","x":-371,"y":1301,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[2 Tavern.canvas]]"}
	],
